WEBVTT

01:02:00.383 --> 01:02:04.139
CA: If you've got value
from this conversation,

01:02:04.163 --> 01:02:09.512
consider sharing it, sharing those links
with people you know.

01:02:09.536 --> 01:02:10.710
That would be cool.

01:02:10.734 --> 01:02:13.830
And hang in there, everyone.

01:02:13.854 --> 01:02:15.068
These are hard days.

01:02:15.092 --> 01:02:18.521
We know many people are struggling hugely.

01:02:18.545 --> 01:02:21.117
Hang in there. We'll get through it
together somehow.

01:02:21.141 --> 01:02:23.883
And until tomorrow, take care.

01:02:23.907 --> 01:02:25.439
Bye for now.

01:02:25.463 --> 01:02:27.282
WPR: Take care, everyone.